;; Verified public-register citations for the legal entity archived by this repository.
;;
;; Every row is checked live by tools/verify_citations.cljs:
;;   * GET :cite/url must answer HTTP 2xx
;;   * :cite/expect-substring must appear in the response body
;;
;; A URL that cannot be fetched, or whose body no longer carries the claim, is a
;; DRIFT and fails the gate. Nothing is recorded here that was not retrieved.
;;
;; FOUR independent authorities are cited:
;;   * GLEIF, the global LEI system
;;   * ACRA, Singapore's company register, via the State's own open-data publication
;;   * the Philippine Stock Exchange, where the entity's shares are listed
;;   * the issuer itself, on the host it controls
;;
;; THE HOME REGISTER IS NOT CITED. GLEIF names RA000483 as BOTH the register of
;; record and the validation authority, and gives the registration number as
;; 0000016342. RA000483 resolves, in GLEIF's own registry, to:
;;
;;     Companies Register
;;     (Securities and Exchange Commission)
;;     jurisdiction: Philippines
;;     website:      www.sec.gov.ph
;;
;; That host does not answer this gate. www.sec.gov.ph and sec.gov.ph both return
;; HTTP 403 with a Cloudflare interstitial titled "Just a moment...". Passing a bot
;; challenge is out of bounds, so it was not attempted. The Commission's other
;; surfaces were measured too and none of them is a register lookup: eFAST is a
;; JavaScript shell behind a login, and eSPARC's "search" takes an application
;; reference number plus the applicant's e-mail and covers pending applications
;; only. All of this is recorded under :catalog/unreachable below.
;;
;; So the number 0000016342 rests on GLEIF's word alone. No row here claims
;; otherwise, and no row is written against a Philippine SEC URL.
;;
;; A REGISTER OF RECORD IS CITED -- FOR THE CHILD, NOT THE SUBJECT. GLEIF records
;; a direct child, SMIC SG HOLDINGS PTE. LTD., with Singapore UEN 202219950R.
;; Singapore publishes ACRA's register as open data and it answers a plain GET.
;; Asked for that UEN it returns the same name GLEIF gives, byte for byte, plus an
;; issue date, entity type and registered address GLEIF does not carry. That is a
;; national register attesting a number GLEIF only quotes -- one level down the
;; group, and the catalog says so rather than letting it stand in for the parent.
;;
;; WHAT THE EXCHANGE AND GLEIF STATE IDENTICALLY. Queried separately:
;;
;;   ISIN     GLEIF  "isin":"PHY806761029"     PSE  <td>PHY806761029</td>
;;   name     GLEIF  SM INVESTMENTS CORPORATION PSE  SM Investments Corporation
;;   birth    GLEIF  creationDate 1960-01-15    PSE  "incorporated on January 15, 1960"
;;   address  GLEIF  ONE E-COM CENTER, HARBOR DRIVE, PASAY
;;            PSE    10th Flr, OneE-com Center, Harbor Drive, ... Pasay City
;;   child    GLEIF  SM PRIME HOLDINGS, INC.    PSE  "SM Prime Holdings, Inc." (listed as SMPH)
;;
;; The ISIN is the strongest of these: it is an identifier neither body invents, and
;; the two systems were asked for it independently.
;;
;; A CONTRADICTION, RECORDED AND NOT RECONCILED. The exchange's company page states
;; the incorporation date twice and disagrees with itself. Its prose description says
;; "incorporated on January 15, 1960", which is the day GLEIF gives. Its structured
;; "Incorporation Date" field on the same page says May 15, 1960. Both strings are
;; kept as rows (pse-info-incorporated, pse-info-incorp-field) so that neither can be
;; quietly dropped and so the disagreement stays visible. This catalog does not decide
;; which is right; it records that one authority publishes both.
;;
;; ROW KINDS WERE MEASURED, NOT ASSERTED. Every row was re-checked against a swapped
;; URL pointing at AYALA CORPORATION (LEI 254900QJ68UH8GKNGI69, PSE cmpy_id 57) --
;; chosen because it matches on every generic attribute a swap could ride on: also
;; Philippine, also RA000483, also ACTIVE, also legal form WHGH, also the same
;; managing LOU, also a PSE-listed conglomerate holding company. Rows that FAILED the
;; swap are :identity; rows that SURVIVED it are :attribute. The swap moved two rows
;; off the classification they were drafted with:
;;
;;   gleif-ocid-null                drafted :identity, SURVIVED  -> :attribute
;;                                  (Ayala carries "ocid":null too; it is not specific)
;;   gleif-no-direct-parent-reason  drafted :attribute, FAILED   -> :identity
;;                                  (SM files NON_CONSOLIDATING; Ayala files
;;                                   NATURAL_PERSONS -- the reason really does differ)
;;
;; The ACRA rows were swapped against a different Singapore Local Company
;; (UEN 201224644N), and the issuer rows against www.ayala.com. Final split:
;; 43 :identity, 22 :attribute, over 65 rows.

{:catalog/subject
 {:company/legal-name "SM INVESTMENTS CORPORATION"
  :company/lei "254900YB8UATFP21AF80"
  :company/home-register "RA000483 -- Companies Register, Securities and Exchange Commission (Philippines)"
  :company/home-registration-number "0000016342"
  :company/home-register-cited? false
  :company/jurisdiction "PH"}

 :catalog/authorities
 [{:authority/id :gleif
   :authority/name "Global Legal Entity Identifier Foundation"
   :authority/role "Issues and maintains the LEI. Names the register of record."}
  {:authority/id :acra
   :authority/name "Accounting and Corporate Regulatory Authority (Singapore)"
   :authority/role "The register of record for the direct child SMIC SG HOLDINGS PTE. LTD. -- NOT for the subject of this repository."
   :authority/surface "data.gov.sg open-data publication of ACRA's register of corporate entities"}
  {:authority/id :pse
   :authority/name "The Philippine Stock Exchange, Inc."
   :authority/role "The exchange the entity's common shares are listed on. Publishes issuer data it attributes to the SEC Form 17-A."}
  {:authority/id :issuer
   :authority/name "SM Investments Corporation (own website)"
   :authority/role "The entity speaking about itself, on a host it controls."}]

